{
  "info": {
    "name": "Friendwave API",
    "description": "Send an Auth0 access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The first request from a new user creates their account. Successful responses are `{ success: true, data }`; errors are `{ success: false, message }`. Realtime (socket.io): connect with `io(API_URL, { auth: { token } })`. Emit `message:send` { chatId, text } (ack); `posts:watch` / `posts:unwatch` { postIds } to subscribe to live updates for posts on screen; `presence:query` { userIds } (ack → { [id]: online }, chat partners only). Listen for `message:new` / `message:updated` (Message), `message:deleted` ({ id, chatId }), `post:counts` ({ postId, likeCount, commentCount }), `comment:new` ({ postId, comment }), `comment:deleted` ({ postId, commentId }), `reply:new` ({ postId, commentId, reply }), `reply:deleted` ({ postId, commentId, replyId }), `feed:new-post` ({ postId, authorId }), `notification:new` (Notification), `presence:update` ({ userId, online }), `chat:read` ({ chatId }).\n\nGenerated from the API's OpenAPI spec by `npm run postman`. Set `baseUrl` and `token` in the collection variables. Creating things saves their ids for the next requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000",
      "description": "or https://friendwave-api.onrender.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "description": "An Auth0 access token (npm run token)"
    },
    {
      "key": "postId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "commentId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "replyId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "chatId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "messageId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "storyId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "myId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mediaKey",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
